// Strokeline Education Style 4: Blueprint Lab
// Purpose: Copy-ready template. Engineering-drawing look for physics, electronics and circuits.
// Demo topic: Ohm's Law (V = I x R), a simple circuit with a worked example.
// Look: deep blue sheet with a faint square grid, thin cyan drawing frame, a title-block stamp
//   ("SHEET n OF 4") in the corner, dimension-style arrows with end dots, and a strict color code:
//   amber = the main quantity (V), mint = the flow (I), coral = the blocker (R), cyan = structure.
// Scenes: 1 title sheet, 2 circuit anatomy, 3 worked example with formula triangle, 4 recap.
//
// HOW TO REUSE
//  1. Replace "Ohm's Law" and the formula letters on scene 1 (V, =, I, x, R) with your topic.
//  2. Keep the color code: pick one color per quantity and reuse it on every scene.
//  3. Scene 2: the wire is an empty rounded rectangle; each component is a filled shape on top
//     of it (fill = background color hides the wire). Move or rename components freely.
//  4. Scene 3: the triangle is 5 LINE objects. Swap the three letters and the 3 worked-example cards.
//  5. Every scene stays at 12 text objects or fewer (validator limit W_TOO_CROWDED).
//  6. Text color comes from COLOR on a shape, so keep fills dark and text colors light.
//  7. Safe icons: zap, activity, shield, battery, lightbulb, pencil-ruler, flask-conical, star, eraser.
//
// Validator status: run with the Strokeline app validator before publishing.
VERSION 1.0
CANVAS 1920 1080
BACKGROUND #0A2A5E
STYLE clean
FONT neat
STROKE 3

SCENE 1 "Title sheet"
  SAY "Behind every phone charger and light switch sits one tidy rule, and it takes ten seconds to learn."
    DURATION 5s
    TONE hook
  CREATE gv1 AS LINE
    FROM 270 0
    TO 270 1080
    COLOR #123A78
    STROKE 2
    DRAW 0.1s
  END
  CREATE gv2 AS LINE
    FROM 540 0
    TO 540 1080
    COLOR #123A78
    STROKE 2
    DRAW 0.1s
  END
